  "description": "<div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Brand introduction: a doctor-led solution to <strong>youthful ageing and longevity</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Product description: humanpeople is a functional medicine longevity platform giving people the power to defy ageing, increase their healthy lifespan, and prevent chronic disease. We do this using <strong>daily sachets of advanced supplements</strong>, which can be bought off-the-shelf or personalised using our <strong>online health assessment</strong>, as well as a range of <strong>home diagnostic testing (blood, genetics, digestive)</strong>. We are taking a functional medicine approach to longevity by giving personalised solutions targeting the root cause of health issues, all based on clinical research and personal data.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">USP (Unique Selling Point): </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><!--[endif]-->Offering <strong>the widest range of advanced longevity supplements</strong> (like NMN, spermidine, urolithin A) that can be bought from the same place and packaged in convenient daily sachets.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><!--[endif]-->Customers can<strong> increase the personalisation of their supplements</strong> by taking our online functional health assessment with a home blood and/or genetic test.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><!--[endif]-->Unique <strong>one-stop-shop solution for the 70% of IBS sufferers</strong> who actually have a treatable condition called SIBO (small intestinal bacterial overgrowth). </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><!--[endif]-->Dual approach to longevity: Health is complex and is not solved by a single supplement or a single test. We use a wide range of testing and supplementation to 1) build a foundational base for good health and then 2) supercharge for longevity.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Payment terms: monthly in arrears (PayPal preferred, otherwise bank transfer).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Other information: </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><!--[endif]-->Regulated by the Care Quality Commission (CQC) for healthcare and diagnostics. Our approach is evidence-based and clinically tested</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>",
